{
    "id": "05",
    "title": "Middleware Matrix",
    "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12) 0%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #A855F7; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A855F7\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon's <strong>Middleware Matrix</strong> is a zero-latency interceptor pipeline designed for the Onion Model. It orchestrates request flows with sub-microsecond overhead.</p></div><h2>The Onion Protocol</h2><p>Middleware in Photon is not just a list; it is a recursive execution stack. Each layer has full control over the upstream request and downstream response, enabling powerful bidirectional transformations.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 10 10\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">ASYNC_CHAIN</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Optimized for JIT-async iteration. Chains are pre-compiled into a flat execution array during the boot phase.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><path d=\"M9 21V9\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">CONTEXT_FLOW</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Leverages Scoped Context to pass data between layers without global pollution or expensive object cloning.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(168,85,247,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">SMART_GATES</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Integrated with Path-Based Routing. Only relevant middleware are dispatched for specific request patterns.</p></div></div><h2>Implementation Patterns</h2><p>Middleware registration is declarative. From logging to high-frequency binary translation, order of operation defines the matrix topology.</p><pre><code>app.use(async (c, next) => {\n  // 1. PRE-PHASE (Incoming Request)\n  const telemetryId = crypto.randomUUID()\n  \n  await next()\n  \n  // 2. POST-PHASE (Outgoing Response)\n  c.header('X-Trace-Id', telemetryId)\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #A855F7; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #A855F7; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// PROTOCOL_ADVISORY: HALTING_MECHANISM</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">If you return a response <strong>before</strong> calling <code>await next()</code>, the entire pipeline halts immediately. This is the optimal strategy for Authorization Gates and Rate Limiting.</p></div><h2>Dispatch Latency</h2><p>Analysis of stack execution time per middleware layer. Photon maintains linear performance even at 50+ nested levels.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #A855F7; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_PIPELINE_DISPATCH (Per Layer)</span> <span>0.008μs</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(168,85,247,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 5%; background: #A855F7; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(168,85,247,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>RECURSIVE_PROMISE_OVERHEAD (Legacy)</span> <span>0.42μs</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 90%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// LATENCY REDUCTION: ~50X FASTER DISPATCH COMPARED TO STANDARD PATTERNS</p></div><h2>Core Integrations</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">Binary Protocol</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Converts JSON to CBOR on-the-fly via Content Negotiation.</p><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>import { binaryMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\napp.use(binaryMiddleware())</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">HTMX Engine</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Auto-detects HX-headers and populates safe context state.</p><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>import { htmxMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\napp.use(htmxMiddleware())</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #EAB308; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Developer Insight:</strong> Middleware executed after <code>await next()</code> can access the final response status and headers. This is the perfect place for Audit Logging or Response Compression.</p></div>",
    "meta": {
        "lastUpdated": "2026-01-20",
        "complexity": "MID_LEVEL",
        "category": "PIPELINE"
    }
}